uple of times in your past responses.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DASH 2023 Q4","e":"dash","d":"2024-02-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Bernard McTernan","x":"I saw you guys put through some price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DASH 2024 Q2","e":"dash","d":"2024-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Xu","x":"I don’t think I’ve ever spoken to a consumer who’s asked us to raise prices.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DASH 2024 Q2","e":"dash","d":"2024-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Xu","x":"And so we are always trying to lower the fees and pass them on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DASH 2024 Q3","e":"dash","d":"2024-10-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Tony Xu","x":"Then you saw the announcement and partnership with MAX, which happened a couple of months ago in terms of adding streaming benefits to DashPass subscribers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DASH 2024 Q3","e":"dash","d":"2024-10-30","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Bernie McTernan","x":"I know you also partner with streaming companies, for example, but is there anything different here with the list that there is the driver component as well?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DASH 2025 Q1","e":"dash","d":"2025-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tony Xu","x":"With respect to the second question, which I believe is on tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"DASH 2025 Q1","e":"dash","d":"2025-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tony Xu","x":"Obviously, as you know, a lot of the tariffs have been paused and we haven't seen any changes in consumer behavior even if there are changes in c